<title>MALAYSIA: Tasek Cement, Metroplex suspended.</title>
<headline>Tasek Cement, Metroplex suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Tasek Cement Bhd and Metroplex Bhd were suspended on Monday, an official from the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange (KLSE) said.</p>
<p>Metroplex, which is involved in housing and property development as well as hotel services and gaming, was suspended at the company's request, the exchange said. Its stock closed on Friday at 2.96 ringgit.</p>
<p>Tasek Cement shares were suspended for company results, the KLSE said. Shares of the cement maker closed at 7.00 ringgit on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
